Whenever this creature attacks, look at the top six cards of your library. You may reveal a Dragon card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order."""@en ;
    :oracleText """Haste
Whenever this creature attacks, look at the top six cards of your library. You may reveal a Dragon card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order."""@en ;
    :flavorText """Conflict is a constant. Only the enemies change."""@en ;
